scans, and the declared Node-engine intersection. No unsupported payload or resource failure was manufactured to promote those qualifications into findings. Malformed missing-active storage and a raw-truthy-receipt authority bypass were not established in the actual mounted path. Jam reconciliation may retry the exact original after not-found; it is not Counter's check-only policy and creates no replacement signature.\n\nFour Source readers freshly read BODY and native U3 for all31 authored paths:62 units/428439bytes/8289LF. Root FULL-read every final analysis and evidence seal and verified all five group audits. The independent native union audit passed with exact path coverage, disjoint owners and matching native hashes/bytes/LF: [Source union audit](/var/folders/2x/wylr59t17ds36l1l7ng25y7w0000gn/T/artroom-checker-jam654-root-od_vqdop/source-union-audit.json), SHA8a2e0f8918dc2cfc518c8b02dc4ab47041d56fb49b55595f328ddcb1c10919ce. This audit checks reading correspondence, not a runtime outcome. Detailed group seals retain fresh dependency spans, exact metadata and evidence limits.\n\nRead deviations remain explicit. Truncated locating/schema outputs received zero complete-reading credit. Two explicitly whitelisted scripted TAP diagnostics were read under an earlier ambiguous diagnostic allowance, then isolated with zero qualified Root/Source FULL credit. They contained case/scalar403-versus503/Node-stack data, with no keys, headers, native captures or private compiler payloads. No further raw logs were read. No universal no-raw-log-read claim is made.\n\nNo project code, test, compiler, gate, browser, provider, model or audio operation was executed by checker. Source and Git were not edited. Native factory/legitimate actors/grants, actual complete replay, private custody recovery, chosen model output, browser/audio/listening, recording, rights, hosting, public registry and full73d/1341 acceptance remain open. The three superseded narrow-review conditions are retained